[Music]  Brody Jenner is set to tie the knot any  day now with his longtime fiancee  Caitlyn Carter in Bali but one person  who won't be in attendance for their I  Do's the 34 year olds dad Caitlyn Jenner  a source tells ET the 68 year olds will  not attend her son's wedding due to  previously scheduled work commitments  but adds that everything is good between  them in fact according to the source the  former Olympian is throwing a party for  Brody and Kaitlynn when they return to  Los Angeles following their wedding and  while Caitlyn may not be there for her  son's big day she did celebrate her  future daughter-in-law in April  attending her bridal shower at the Santa  Anita Park Racetrack in Los Angeles  alongside Brody's mom Linda Thompson  Caitlyn shared this shot of her with a  29 year old writing went to my first  bridal shower for a Brody's fiance  Caitlyn Carter I had so much fun  PS so much better than bachelor parties  Carter commented on the post quote I'm  so happy you were there it meant a lot  to me  [Music]  [Applause]

